<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15043" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for reckoning, skilled therein,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					453e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>arithmetical,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archyt.
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλογία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1106a35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἓν ἁπλῶς οὐκ ἦν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					117
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀριθμητική</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>arithmetic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				525a
			</span></i>, al.; as a subject of competition, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
				107
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ. ἐπιστήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.979e
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				643c
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.116H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i>land-tax</i> in Egypt, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τέλειον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4415.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιτέλειον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					330.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
